#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:44
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Ncurses"
msgstr "Instalação do Ncurses"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:46
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"First, run the following commands to build the <command>tic</command> "
"program on the build host. We install it in <filename "
"class=\"directory\">$LFS/tools</filename>, so that it is found in the "
"<envar>PATH</envar> when needed:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, execute os seguintes comandos para construir o programa "
"<command>tic</command> no anfitrião de construção. Nós o instalamos em "
"<filename class=\"directory\">$LFS/tools</filename> de forma que ele seja "
"encontrado no <envar>PATH</envar> quando necessário:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:51
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">mkdir build\n"
"pushd build\n"
"  ../configure --prefix=$LFS/tools AWK=gawk\n"
"  make -C include\n"
"  make -C progs tic\n"
"  install progs/tic $LFS/tools/bin\n"
"popd</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"pre\">mkdir build\n"
"pushd build\n"
"  ../configure --prefix=$LFS/tools AWK=gawk\n"
"  make -C include\n"
"  make -C progs tic\n"
"  install progs/tic $LFS/tools/bin\n"
"popd</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:59
#, xml-text
msgid "Prepare Ncurses for compilation:"
msgstr "Prepare o Ncurses para compilação:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:61
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">./configure --prefix=/usr                \\\n"
"            --host=$LFS_TGT              \\\n"
"            --build=$(./config.guess)    \\\n"
"            --mandir=/usr/share/man      \\\n"
"            --with-manpage-format=normal \\\n"
"            --with-shared                \\\n"
"            --without-normal             \\\n"
"            --with-cxx-shared            \\\n"
"            --without-debug              \\\n"
"            --without-ada                \\\n"
"            --disable-stripping          \\\n"
"            AWK=gawk</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"configure\">./configure --prefix=/usr                \\\n"
"            --host=$LFS_TGT              \\\n"
"            --build=$(./config.guess)    \\\n"
"            --mandir=/usr/share/man      \\\n"
"            --with-manpage-format=normal \\\n"
"            --with-shared                \\\n"
"            --without-normal             \\\n"
"            --with-cxx-shared            \\\n"
"            --without-debug              \\\n"
"            --without-ada                \\\n"
"            --disable-stripping          \\\n"
"            AWK=gawk</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:75
#, xml-text
msgid "The meaning of the new configure options:"
msgstr "O significado das novas opções de configuração:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:78
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--with-manpage-format=normal</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--with-manpage-format=normal</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:80
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This prevents Ncurses from installing compressed manual pages, which may "
"happen if the host distribution itself has compressed manual pages."
msgstr ""
"Isso evita que o Ncurses instale páginas de manual comprimidas, o que "
"possivelmente aconteça se a própria distribuição anfitriã tiver páginas de "
"manual comprimidas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:87
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--with-shared</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--with-shared</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:89
#, xml-text
msgid "This makes Ncurses build and install shared C libraries."
msgstr ""
"Isso faz com que o Ncurses construa e instale bibliotecas C compartilhadas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:94
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--without-normal</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--without-normal</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:96
#, xml-text
msgid "This prevents Ncurses from building and installing static C libraries."
msgstr "Isso evita que o Ncurses construa e instale bibliotecas C estáticas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:102
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--without-debug</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--without-debug</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:104
#, xml-text
msgid "This prevents Ncurses from building and installing debug libraries."
msgstr "Isso evita que o Ncurses construa e instale bibliotecas de depuração."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:110
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--with-cxx-shared</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--with-cxx-shared</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:112
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This makes Ncurses build and install shared C++ bindings. It also prevents "
"it building and installing static C++ bindings."
msgstr ""
"Isso faz com que o Ncurses construa e instale vínculos C++ compartilhados. "
"Também evita a construção e instalação de vínculos C++ estáticos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:118
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--without-ada</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--without-ada</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:120
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This ensures that Ncurses does not build support for the Ada compiler, which"
" may be present on the host but will not be available once we enter the "
"<command>chroot</command> environment."
msgstr ""
"Isso assegura que o Ncurses não construa suporte para o compilador Ada, o "
"qual possivelmente esteja presente no anfitrião, porém não estará disponível"
" até que nós entremos no ambiente <command>chroot</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:127
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>--disable-stripping</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>--disable-stripping</parameter>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This switch prevents the building system from using the "
"<command>strip</command> program from the host.  Using host tools on cross-"
"compiled programs can cause failure."
msgstr ""
"Essa chave impede o sistema de construção de usar o aplicativo "
"<command>strip</command> oriundo do anfitrião. Usar ferramentas do anfitrião"
" em aplicativos compilados cruzadamente pode causar falha."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:136
#, xml-text
msgid "<parameter>AWK=gawk</parameter>"
msgstr "<parameter>AWK=gawk</parameter>"

#.  FIXME vauge
#.  It seems happened in 2015,
#.           is there any updated into?
#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:138
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"This switch prevents the building system from using the "
"<command>mawk</command> program from the host.  Some versions of "
"<command>mawk</command> can cause this package to fail to build."
msgstr ""
"Essa chave impede o sistema de construção de usar o programa "
"<command>mawk</command> oriundo do anfitrião. Algumas versões do "
"<command>mawk</command> podem causar esse pacote falhar para construir."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:147
#, xml-text
msgid "Compile the package:"
msgstr "Compile o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:149
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput remap=\"make\">make</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput remap=\"make\">make</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:151
#, xml-text
msgid "Install the package:"
msgstr "Instale o pacote:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:153
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">make DESTDIR=$LFS install\n"
"ln -sv libncursesw.so $LFS/usr/lib/libncurses.so\n"
"sed -e 's/^#if.*XOPEN.*$/#if 1/' \\\n"
"    -i $LFS/usr/include/curses.h</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput remap=\"install\">make DESTDIR=$LFS install\n"
"ln -sv libncursesw.so $LFS/usr/lib/libncurses.so\n"
"sed -e 's/^#if.*XOPEN.*$/#if 1/' \\\n"
"    -i $LFS/usr/include/curses.h</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><title>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:159
#, xml-text
msgid "The meaning of the install options:"
msgstr "O significado das opções de instalação:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:162
#, xml-text
msgid "<command>ln -sv libncursesw.so $LFS/usr/lib/libncurses.so</command>"
msgstr "<command>ln -sv libncursesw.so $LFS/usr/lib/libncurses.so</command>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The <filename>libncurses.so</filename> library is needed by a few packages "
"we will build soon. We create this symlink to use "
"<filename>libncursesw.so</filename> as a replacement."
msgstr ""
"A biblioteca <filename>libncurses.so</filename> é necessária para uns poucos"
" pacotes que nós construiremos breve. Nós criamos esse link simbólico para "
"usar a <filename>libncursesw.so</filename> como uma substituta."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><term>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:171
#, xml-text
msgid "<command>sed -e 's/^#if.*XOPEN.*$/#if 1/' ...</command>"
msgstr "<command>sed -e 's/^#if.*XOPEN.*$/#if 1/' ...</command>"

#. type: Content of:
#. <sect1><sect2><variablelist><varlistentry><listitem><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:173
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The header file <filename>curses.h</filename> contains the definition of "
"various Ncurses data structures.  With different preprocessor macro "
"definitions two different sets of the data structure definition may be used:"
" the 8-bit definition is compatible with <filename>libncurses.so</filename> "
"and the wide-character definition is compatible with "
"<filename>libncursesw.so</filename>.  Since we are using "
"<filename>libncursesw.so</filename> as a replacement of "
"<filename>libncurses.so</filename>, edit the header file so it will always "
"use the wide-character data structure definition compatible with "
"<filename>libncursesw.so</filename>."
msgstr ""
"O arquivo de cabeçalho <filename>curses.h</filename> contém a definição de "
"várias estruturas de dados do Ncurses. Com diferentes definições de macro de"
" pré processador, dois conjuntos de definição de estrutura de dados podem "
"ser usados: a definição de oito bits é compatível com a "
"<filename>libncurses.so</filename> e a definição de caracteres largos é "
"compatível com a <filename>libncursesw.so</filename>. Como estamos usando a "
"<filename>libncursesw.so</filename> como uma substituta da "
"<filename>libncurses.so</filename>, edite o arquivo de cabeçalho de forma "
"que ele sempre usará a definição de estrutura de dados de caracteres largos "
"compatível com a <filename>libncursesw.so</filename>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: lfs-en/chapter06/ncurses.xml:194
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Details on this package are located in <xref linkend=\"contents-ncurses\" "
"role=\".\"/>"
msgstr ""
"Detalhes acerca deste pacote estão localizados na <xref linkend=\"contents-"
"ncurses\" role=\".\"/>"

